{# goal: Guide the report phase. #}
{# Variables: target (string), findings (list), proposals (list, each with its approved flag), executions (list, each with its success flag) #}
{# Output: a therapy session report #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    target:
      type: string
      non_blank: true
    findings: array
    proposals: array
    executions: array
  output:
    report: string
---

You are producing the therapy session report for "{{ target }}".

{% set approved_proposals = proposals | selectattr("approved", "equalto", true) | list %}
{% set contradiction_ids = findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "contradiction") | map(attribute="id") | list %}
{% set fragmentation_ids = findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "fragmentation") | map(attribute="id") | list %}
{% set confidence_ids = findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "miscalibrated_confidence") | map(attribute="id") | list %}

{% if proposals %}
## Proposals

{{ proposals | tojson }}

{% endif %}
{% if executions %}
## Execution Results

{{ executions | tojson }}

{% endif %}

## Report structure

### Memory hygiene summary (forgetting — not learning)

- Contradictions found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "contradiction") | list | length }}
- Contradictions resolved: {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("finding_id", "in", contradiction_ids) | list | length }}
- Fragmented memories found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "fragmentation") | list | length }}
- Fragmented memories resolved: {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("finding_id", "in", fragmentation_ids) | list | length }}
- Miscalibrated confidence found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "miscalibrated_confidence") | list | length }}
- Confidence recalibrated: {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("finding_id", "in", confidence_ids) | list | length }}
- Source memories purged (post-reification): {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "purge") | list | length }}
- Source memories condensed (post-reification): {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "condense") | list | length }}
- Executions succeeded: {{ executions | selectattr("success", "equalto", true) | list | length }} of {{ executions | list | length }}

### Reification summary (learning — closes the learning loop)

- Reification candidates found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "reification_candidate") | list | length }}
- Skills created: {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "create_skill") | list | length }}
- Templates created: {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "create_template") | list | length }}
- Rules created: {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "create_rule") | list | length }}

### Values alignment summary (when the values pass ran)

- Charter version reviewed: <version>
- Values practiced / thin / conflicted: <counts per value>
- Conflicts found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "charter_alignment") | list | length }} (each with lesson + value citations)
- Practice gaps carded: {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "record_practice_gap") | list | length }}

### Per-issue detail

For each finding, report:
- **Finding**: ID, issue type, entity, description.
- **Process**: hygiene | reification | post-reification hygiene | values alignment.
- **Proposal**: strategy, action, reason.
- **User decision**: approved / modified / rejected.
- **Execution**: success / failure, outcome.
- **Reification** (if applicable): what skill/template/rule was created.

### Recommendations

- Follow-up therapy sessions (e.g., "run another session after the next consolidation cycle").
- Skill effectiveness review (e.g., "review the new skill's effectiveness after N invocations").
- Remaining reification candidates (e.g., "3 reification candidates were not addressed — consider a follow-up session").
- Memory database health (e.g., "memory database is now at N h_mems, down from M — within storage budget").

## Output format

Produce a markdown report with the sections above. Be honest — report failures, report when nothing was found, do not fabricate success.
